 ## Background
-This technique was developed as part of the "X13" batch render job for 3D isosurface figures, specifically to address visual clutter and occlusion issues in scientific visualization [S1, unofficial]. It was implemented in the CoarseGrainedKHAPE project using the Makie visualization library [S1, unofficial]. The method emerged from iterative testing of isosurfaces and filled surfaces, which proved problematic due to color matching, occlusion, and alpha handling limitations in GLMakie [S1, unofficial].
